indices from -m through m. NPhotonBlocks[{amplitude, vectorPotential, omega}, \
m][finalPoint, initialPoint] constructs the scalar Peierls modulation from a \
time-dependent vector potential and its amplitude. \
NPhotonBlocks[{vectorPotential, omega}, m][finalPoint, initialPoint] uses \
unit vector-potential amplitude.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, 
